      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For high-traffic commercial lobbies, polished concrete offers exceptional durability and a modern aesthetic, handling heavy footfall very well with minimal long-term maintenance beyond periodic sealing. Natural stone provides a high-end, prestigious look but can be prone to scratching and requires more regular sealing and potential refinishing. LVT is incredibly resilient to wear and tear and is very easy to clean, often requiring the least intensive maintenance overall compared to the other two options.",
