      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. one more thing—i've heard some people say that sometimes floors seem to get these weird little scuffs or marks that don't really look like they came from shoes or something logical. is there anything else that might cause unexpected surface degradation besides just normal walking or cleaning? maybe something about the environmental factors or the way light hits them?",
